# CLI / wizard changes → documentation

When editing matched CLI or wizard paths:

1. Update [README.md](../../README.md) — commands, flags, setup, examples.
2. If dependency strictness, repair, or mechanic focus UX changes: update [planning/11-dependency-engine-user-experience.md](../../planning/11-dependency-engine-user-experience.md).
3. Run **`/sync-documentation`** before PR.

User-facing behavior must not drift from README.
